constructor
  ├── it should set the pool addresses provider
  ├── when vault is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when pool addresses provider is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  └── when the asset is not a listed reserve on the pool
      └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__AssetMismatch
